 .IP \fBAddHeader\fR 4
 .IX Item "AddHeader"
 Configure one or more HTTP request headers to be added to outgoing
 HTTP requests that Tinyproxy makes. Note that this option will not
 work for HTTPS traffic, as Tinyproxy has no control over what
